# Single-deploy web (the default): leave VITE_API_URL UNSET. In production the site calls "/api" on its own address.
# Only set it for local dev against another port, or for the Capacitor/Android build.
#
# Copy to .env and adjust. Vite reads VITE_* at build time.
#
# Web dev:               http://localhost:3001/api
# Android emulator:      http://10.0.2.2:3001/api   (10.0.2.2 is the emulator's alias for your PC)
# Real phone on Wi-Fi:   http://<your-pc-lan-ip>:3001/api
# Production:            https://your-api.example.com/api   (Android requires https in release builds)
# VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:3001/api
